	)
	(text_box "A POLOLU stepper controller drives a stepper motor in step with the joystick position. The\nstepper motor spindle is coupled to the hydraulic valve spindle. A microswitch detects\nspindle position and allows the controller to properly initialise the stepper motor.\n\n "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 143.51 90.17 0)
		(size 85.09 31.75)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f191201-6fd6-42b6-bced-e3d5915219c2")
	)
	(text_box ""
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 229.87 116.84 0)
		(size 0 0)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "46946952-ded0-4e2f-95aa-8936453f6be8")
	)
	(text_box "The trolling system implements an electronic control interface to a hydraulic trolling valve.\n\nThe engine control panel ignition-on terminal provides all system power.  "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.605 127 0)
		(size 158.75 64.77)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5b2c67f8-9f82-43fe-ba80-7ea5244f0dfe")
	)
	(text_box "The troll valve system is powered from the main engine\nignition switch auxilliary supply ENG.IGN via the Troll\nSystem Relay (TSR) mounted in the helm cabinet. TSR\nprovides two power rails:\n\nHP.ENG.IGN.SBY is live when the engine ignition switch\nis ON and engine RPMs are below the tachometer alarm\nthreshold. This supply is used to power the troll\nsystem.\n\nHP.ENG.IGN.ALM is live when the engine ignition switch\nis ON and engine RPMs are above the tachometer alarm\nthreshold. This supply is used to power the troll\nsystem overspeed alarm LED.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.605 90.17 0)
		(size 59.69 31.75)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6231b8c7-18b0-4681-99f0-fc07c0f99788")
	)
