	)
	(text_box "When the system is powered, a voltage regulator\nproduces a 5V output which feeds the positive\nrail of a joystick operated potentiometer. Wiper\noutput from the potentiometer is fed via the\nengine loom to the engine connection cabinet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 74.295 90.17 0)
		(size 56.515 31.115)
		(stroke
